gories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"M-6AXSgmDMYcWsF442mzzA","review_id":"AAdpjefPeLyFmTQ0M_ynKQ","date":"2021-02-18T23:51:11","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9414523839950562,"text_excerpt":"I have to say that Seither's is such a great spot for some seafood and seeing how much they have adapted in the midst of a pandemic. I went with a friend and thank goodness I did because I was led on how to navigate properly. They have a few outdoor tables to enjoy and a stage for live music. I'm super impressed on how they catch their own seafood, as well as, support local fisherman with their daily catches. We started off with the cajun street corn and their home fries. Great fillers and starters for the table! Thought it was neat how the home fries are actually the potatoes from the boil and deep friend. GENIUS. Next up was a signature dish of their and I'm bummed I can't remember the ..."},{"business_id":"M-6AXSgmDMYcWsF442mzzA","review_id":"jgxDn_inSnvz43H4-Mpb7Q","date":"2017-04-02T19:00:46","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9369465112686157,"text_excerpt":"This was my first time checking this place out and it will definitely not be my last! I had heard it was small on the inside and sometimes a long wait for a table so when I was parking there was a crowd outside which scared me. Come to find out it was just a big group eating boiled crawfish at the tables outside. We walked in and got a table right away and was ordering our drinks and looking at the menu. Unlike all the great Louisiana seafood places in the area they do it a little different it's Louisiana seafood with an Asian mix. They do have some regular seafood platters and boiled. We ordered 3 appetizers the Frog legs which were excellent with a great tasting batter and sauce on them..."},{"business_id":"M-6AXSgmDMYcWsF442mzzA","review_id":"9ELLdCTclOXddkJVv3jWRA","date":"2019-05-22T15:41:59","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9355578422546387,"text_excerpt":"If you're looking for a creative and out of the ordinary seafood spot, Seither's Seafood is the place to go. The restaurant is located in an area you wouldn't expect these masterpieces would be at but it's worth the drive over. I always make sure to order the Eggplant Harahan, it's something you probably have never tried. The sauce and the crab add great flavors to it and it's a great plate to share. If you want more variety, the Shrimp OMG will do that with the different sauces they put all over. This time I ordered the Rock N' Roll Po-Boy and it did not disappoint. A bit messy and hard to eat but well worth it at the end. Finished up our meal with the fried bread pudding and it was deli..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"M-6AXSgmDMYcWsF442mzzA","photo_id":"EW7J8ghM8lQVvPGdhuze3w","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/EW7J8ghM8lQVvPGdhuze3w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8969904184341431},{"business_id":"M-6AXSgmDMYcWsF442mzzA","photo_id":"OAvdXzcWmKyNI7qHUo3qcQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/OAvdXzcWmKyNI7qHUo3qcQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8894811272621155},{"business_id":"M-6AXSgmDMYcWsF442mzzA","photo_id":"wONH0gA0bR-BcEWLY3fQlg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/wONH0gA0bR-BcEWLY3fQlg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8357417583465576},{"business_id":"M-6AXSgmDMYcWsF442mzzA","photo_id":"i720mHJcLIRj97EbGlo1uw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/i720mHJcLIRj97EbGlo1uw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8053371906280518},{"business_id":"M-6AXSgmDMYcWsF442mzzA","photo_id":"yYx-6Lcwy9rnSrjrm3